# Client work: configs with real ids, briefs, build records, flowcharts. Never committed.
# (Not tied to the root on purpose: an old-style tools/ghl/clients/ folder is caught too.)
clients/

# The checker's list of forbidden strings, if someone keeps it next to the checker.
tools/check-repo.forbidden.txt

# templates/ holds data only: a render of the flowcharts template does not belong there.
templates/*.html
templates/*.pdf

# Tools and OS junk
node_modules/
*.tmp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# dist/*.zip stays tracked on purpose: it is the release for agents that cannot clone GitHub
# (see dist/README.md).
